aphilias and the different sides of sexuality, trying to find the road to happiness."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Cinco historias de amor y curiosas filias sexuales coinciden en un calenturiento verano madrileño. Dacrifilia, Elifilia, Somnofilia y Harpaxofilia son algunas de las particulares formas de obtener placer que descubren nuestros protagonistas, pero para disfrutarlas tendrán que decidir cómo integrarlas en sus vidas. Sus sentimientos, sus miedos y sobre todo su sexualidad se transforman rompiendo tabúes, adentrándose en una etapa nueva, emocionante y libre donde no se reniega ni del placer ni del amor.","tagline":"Una comedia erótico-festiva de Paco León"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2wMK92PUf80byUxYezRegmsOv56.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/erIfV6Xm60tsEySsrDolb8DoqNP.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":370978,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2wMK92PUf80byUxYezRegmsOv56.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2wMK92PUf80byUxYezRegmsOv56.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2wMK92PUf80byUxYezRegmsOv56.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2wMK92PUf80byUxYezRegmsOv56.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/16LZn5Z6QZ1gWmLQQn4EcdnV9q6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/16LZn5Z6QZ1gWmLQQn4EcdnV9q6.jpg","language":"en","width":666,"height":999},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/16LZn5Z6QZ1gWmLQQn4EcdnV9q6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/16LZn5Z6QZ1gWmLQQn4EcdnV9q6.jpg","language":"en","width"